OL,3,ATrump waves green flag to start IndyCar
OL,4,Arace through Washington streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump was among
OL,7,Fhundreds of people who gathered to see
OL,8,Fthe IndyCar race through the streets of
OL,9,FWashington DC on Sunday, marking the
OL,10,Fculmination of a series of summer
OL,11,Fevents to celebrate the country's 250th
OL,12,Fbirthday.
OL,14,FDriver Kyle Kirkwood won the race,
OL,15,Fearning his seventh career Indycar win.
OL,17,FAhead of the race, the president and
OL,18,FFirst Lady Melania Trump took a
OL,19,Fceremonial lap of the 1.7-mile track in
OL,20,Fhis presidential limousine, The Beast.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
